
"smart_sources:2026-06-09 - ‘Pretty clear and clean’_ McCall P&Z advances D&B Supply proposal.md": {"path":"2026-06-09 - ‘Pretty clear and clean’_ McCall P&Z advances D&B Supply proposal.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"1f5871v","at":1785795033169},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1783541248144,"size":6902,"at":1785795033222,"hash":"1f5871v"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,9],"#":[10,33],"##Parking lot landscaping, lighting upgrades required":[34,53],"##Parking lot landscaping, lighting upgrades required#{1}":[36,53],"##P&Z: Expanded formula business analysis ‘fine’ this time":[54,86],"##P&Z: Expanded formula business analysis ‘fine’ this time#{1}":[56,86]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Drew Dodson - Valley Lookout Editor","target":"Drew Dodson - Valley Lookout Editor","line":5},{"title":"formerly occupied by Rite Aid","target":"https://valleylookout.com/2025/05/27/mccall-rite-aid-closure/","line":18},{"title":"the Caldwell-based farm supply retailer","target":"https://www.dbsupply.com/","line":18},{"title":"St. Luke's Health Plan - 2026 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/3cffa70b-bd30-43bc-8a9e-62008bbc7dff.png","line":20,"embedded":true},{"title":"Western States - Lookout creative - 4:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/115c0cfa-e547-4a5c-8f4e-7ea7e16f8bde.png","line":30,"embedded":true},{"title":"St. Luke's Health Plan - 2026 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/3cffa70b-bd30-43bc-8a9e-62008bbc7dff.png","line":46,"embedded":true},{"title":"D&B","target":"https://www.dbsupply.com/","line":56},{"title":"St. Luke's Health Plan - 2026 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/3cffa70b-bd30-43bc-8a9e-62008bbc7dff.png","line":58,"embedded":true},{"title":"“formula” business under city code","target":"https://codelibrary.amlegal.com/codes/mccallid/latest/mccall_id/0-0-0-1681","line":62},{"title":"Valley Lookout house - Drew","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/12c5b6ba-e344-4f74-a83b-fe4af9ea9df5.gif","line":68,"embedded":true},{"title":"St. Luke's Health Plan - 2026 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/3cffa70b-bd30-43bc-8a9e-62008bbc7dff.png","line":78,"embedded":true}],"metadata":{"title":"‘Pretty clear and clean’: McCall P&Z advances D&B Supply proposal","source":"https://valleylookout.com/2026/06/09/pretty-clear-and-clean-mccall-pz-advances-db-supply-proposal/","author":["[[Drew Dodson - Valley Lookout Editor]]"],"published":"2026-06-09","created":"2026-07-08","description":"Plans to open a D&B Supply store in McCall passed muster on Tuesday night with the McCall Planning and Zoning Commission.  The P&Z voted unanimously to approve the design of the store and recommended approval of permitting the company needs to the McCall City Council, which will make a final decision on the proposal.  Plans […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},